OpenLambda robot inference

The observation alignment, Lambda0 preprocessing, hand-target clamping,
signed action envelope and runtime attachment logic are adapted from the
lambda0-inference deployment workspace. This extraction removes model registry,
web console, task-specific configuration and automatic service deployment,
and uses the public lambda0 serve API for model loading and prediction.

SONIC, hardware SDKs and model weights remain separately installed components
under their original licenses. The inference client contains no weights or device SDKs.
